Advanced power quality and metering study (@pe-power-quality-study: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electrical-power-engineering, #source "../sources/AC-Electrical-Circuit-Analysis-Fiore.lingua#r_0C4FYP5P0A5GQP13HAD8FTEEWK", #source "../sources/Electrical-Installation-Guide-Schneider.lingua#r_045M70B905F19RA4E6FTNXFC0V", #source "../sources/OpenDSS-Distribution-Modeling-Manual.lingua#r_1192RYEP2NRARXYCHHJDZGXNGN", #source "../sources/Brazilian-Distribution-and-Network-Requirements.lingua#r_447WGES28KC2NYSCXTRQSWN82Y", #electrical-power-engineering "../study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3") { r_5XPWCSB9NRQ7JQPPF46FJWR8C3
**Read:** [AC Electrical Circuit Analysis — James M. Fiore](../sources/AC-Electrical-Circuit-Analysis-Fiore.lingua#r_0C4FYP5P0A5GQP13HAD8FTEEWK), entire book and substantial waveform/power work; [Electrical Installation Guide — Schneider Electric](../sources/Electrical-Installation-Guide-Schneider.lingua#r_045M70B905F19RA4E6FTNXFC0V), complete applicable harmonic/measurement guidance; [OpenDSS — distribution modelling and reference manual](../sources/OpenDSS-Distribution-Modeling-Manual.lingua#r_1192RYEP2NRARXYCHHJDZGXNGN), whole relevant harmonic/model methods; [Brazilian distribution and network requirements — ANEEL and ONS](../sources/Brazilian-Distribution-and-Network-Requirements.lingua#r_447WGES28KC2NYSCXTRQSWN82Y), complete applicable issued measurement/quality modules.

Read all of [AC Electrical Circuit Analysis — James M. Fiore](../sources/AC-Electrical-Circuit-Analysis-Fiore.lingua#r_0C4FYP5P0A5GQP13HAD8FTEEWK), the complete applicable [Electrical Installation Guide — Schneider Electric](../sources/Electrical-Installation-Guide-Schneider.lingua#r_045M70B905F19RA4E6FTNXFC0V) power-quality material, full relevant measurement/requirement definitions and an appropriate harmonic/time-domain model manual. Choose a bounded installation with a concrete useful-service or equipment issue, not merely a desire to reduce one displayed distortion number.

Derive waveform/RMS/active-power quantities, instrument transfer/timing effects and the actual network/load/filter model. Compare fundamental power flow, harmonic analysis and time-domain response. Include unbalance, neutral current, resonance, heating and converter/control effects where the observable requires them. Check calibrated reference, bandwidth, aggregation window and uncertainty.

Use suitable supervised measurement or a complete authorized published case and predict a changed condition independently. Compare at least two mitigation arrangements with loss, ratings and service consequences. Report which current/edition-defined requirement was tested and which broader claims remain unsupported. The result should make the connection from physical waveform through the measurement chain to an engineering decision clear, without mistaking a neat spectrum or improved displacement factor for complete system suitability.

**Continue:** [An integrated electrical-power-system investigation](../study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3).

**Return:** [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ).
